<title>FINLAND: Tamro Jan-April profit rises six percent.</title>
<headline>Tamro Jan-April profit rises six percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			    79 vs 75</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.68 vs 0.62</p>
<p> Net sales					  4,052 vs 4,097</p>
<p> Operating profit				    77 vs 79</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 10 analysts' forecasts for Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler Tamro Oy's profit after financial items had been 71.5 million markka (range 65-84 million markka).  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 108 vs 107</p>
<p> Depreciation					  31 vs 28</p>
<p> Net financial items			 charge 3 vs nil</p>
<p> Share of associated companies results   gain 4 vs 4 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 1 gain</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes		 79 vs 76</p>
<p> Net profit					    59 vs 56</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    45.0 vs 45.6</p>
<p> Return on investment (ROI)(percent)	 13.8 vs 13.6</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE)(percent)	     10.9 vs 10.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Tamro Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245, news@reuters.fi</p>
